              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "fruitdog"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Could only find the Garden Vegetable cream cheese so added fresh garlic to that. The cream cheese taste was good but the salmon was just okay. Needs a bit more of kick for us.",
            "datePublished": "2021-06-19T03:07:00.580Z"
          },
          {
