            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "jrodpagan"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I couldn't find the cream cheese spread indicated in the recipe, so I substituted with Alouette's garlic &amp; herb cheese spread. What a mistake! The sauce did not complement the salmon. I will try the recipe again once I track down the recommended cheese spread.",
